  {
    "ID": 1007441505,
    "key": "2a6185607c8cd46389048d0141c71689ca8cc63e682a0f69b5ec0017befcdf37",
    "original": "This character's humors are exceptionally stable allowing the mind to reflexively resist fear or grief while being highly attuned to positive emotions. Occasionally, they are observed tilting their head in a vacant trance captivated by a faint ringing in their skull.",
    "translation": "该角色的体液异常稳定，这让他的心智能本能地抵抗恐惧和哀伤，又极易和积极情绪共鸣。偶有人发现他神情空洞地歪着头发呆，似乎是被脑海里轻微的嗡鸣声所吸引。",
    "stage": 1,
    "context": "this.m.Description = \"This character's humors are exceptionally stable allowing the mind to reflexively resist fear or grief while being highly attuned to positive emotions. Occasionally, they are observed tilting their head in a vacant trance captivated by a faint ringing in their skull.\""
